                                                "sense_id": "48af50ee-597c-30e7-bf3b-b4273dfeb08f",
                                                "text": "This kind of immediate control structure we take to be characteristic of the tribe, and it leads to a rather rigid type of system in which 'every action not mandatory is forbidden'."
                                            }
